## Harvest

![Two men are engaged in a conversation in an office setting. One man is holding a piece of paper or document, smiling, and appears to be talking or explaining something. The other man, with his back to the camera, is listening. There is a large leafy plant in the background.](/images/pages/harvest/88ec3c7cfc-envato-labs-image-edit--4-.webp)

#### Turn wealth into income, without losing tomorrow.

Retirement isn’t the finish line. We build a rules-based income ladder for reliability now while a growth engine works in the background—so generosity, milestones, and legacy remain in view.

#### What we focus on

-   Cash-flow laddering (near-term cash + long-term growth sleeves)
    
-   Withdrawal policy and guardrails
    
-   Tax coordination across accounts/benefits
    
-   Healthcare/insurance considerations
    
-   Ongoing rebalancing and review rhythm
    
-   Taxes and sequence-of-returns risk are planned for, not reacted to.
    

#### Who it’s for

-   5–10 years from retirement or newly retired
    
-   Couples coordinating pensions, CPP/OAS, and withdrawals
    
-   Households nervous about drawdowns in early retirement
    
-   Caregivers planning around uneven expenses
    

