**_Our approach seeks to balance current income with long-term capital preservation, though all investment strategies involve risk._**

**_While our approach seeks to balance current income with long-term growth, withdrawals during adverse markets may reduce portfolio longevity. Actual results will depend on market conditions and individual circumstances._**

